      "writtenOn": "2022-03-08T02:19:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No particular reason, these thresholds were taken from legacy implementation.\nI noticed that we have a voltage division that lowers nominal ADC input voltage to ~2720 mV (~82.4%). Considering this, we could set both thresholds to 2175 mV (~80% of real input voltage).",
